centration (B4\u00d73 plus B1, B3, B5, B6). This increases flexibility for forming either pungs with B4 or chows in the B suit, while keeping my hand more unified and improving chances for patterns like \"Half Flush\" or \"All Pungs.\"\n\nAnswer: Play J1"}
